# lynote-notetaker
===
 Local AI note taker for meetings. Records calls with no bot, transcribes on your computer with Whisper, and writes AI meeting notes and minutes. Built for long meetings in Chinese; 9 spoken languages. Recordings never leave your computer. Free for Windows and Linux. Open-source alternative to Otter and Granola..
